  "material_learning": "ATR-normalized EMA20 curvature is causal, decision-time available, selective and broad, but negative curvature is not a low-value DRA entry state. The zero threshold removed 26 of 51 capacity-admissible Validation signals and reduced realized and total PnL by 47.40846158 USDT. Validation drawdown improved by 3.097158 percentage points, maximum underwater duration fell by 460 hours and median/P90 holding improved, but this came from suppressing profitable participation rather than producing independent alpha. Only 2022 improved; 2020, 2021, 2023 and 2024 all lost total PnL, and both rejection-only neighbors also materially reduced Validation realized, total and risk-adjusted performance. A smoother equity path is not a strategy improvement when it discards most of the economic return.",
